  "edge_schema": "voltmarkt_edge_pat",
  "prompt": "For a revenue chart, each category shows its 3 best-selling products of 2025 by net revenue, plus one \"All other\" row with the revenue of the rest of its products. Use the sales rows whose order_date falls in 2025 (order_date is a UTC day). Keep exactly 3 products per category. When products tie on revenue, the lower product_id comes first. Return three columns, in this order: category_name, item (the product_name for a product kept, or the text All other) and revenue, its 2025 net revenue. A category with 3 or fewer products that sold in 2025 has no All other row. Return one row for each product kept and each All other row. Any row order is fine.",
  "output_contract": {
